# ============================================================
# 检查单填写记录接口测试（/api/checklists/records*）
# 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件
# 注意：POST 创建的记录请记录返回的 id，用于后续 GET/PUT
# ============================================================

@base = http://localhost:5183/api

### 1. 查询填写记录列表（全部，按检查时间倒序）
GET {{base}}/checklists/records
Accept: application/json

### 2. 按航班日期精确查询（如 2026-07-31）
GET {{base}}/checklists/records?date=2026-07-31
Accept: application/json

### 3. 按航班 ID 查询
GET {{base}}/checklists/records?flightId=FL-CARGO-001
Accept: application/json

### 4. 创建填写记录（draft 草稿）
POST {{base}}/checklists/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": "FL-CARGO-001",
  "flightNo": "Y81111",
  "aircraftType": "B757",
  "flightType": "常规航班",
  "checklistCategory": "货运航班",
  "checklistTemplateId": "cargo-checklist",
  "checklistTitle": "货运航班节点保障及合规性监控检查单",
  "flightDate": "2026-07-31",
  "header": { "date": "2026-07-31", "flightNo": "Y81111" },
  "items": {
    "main-1": { "status": "ok", "time": "09:30", "note": "正常" },
    "main-2": { "status": "ok", "time": "09:40" }
  },
  "videoSupervision": {},
  "inspector": "测试员",
  "status": "draft",
  "checkedAt": "2026-07-31T01:30:00Z"
}

### 5. 查询单个填写记录（将上面返回的 id 填入）
GET {{base}}/checklists/records/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. 更新填写记录（提交：status → submitted）
PUT {{base}}/checklists/records/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "submitted",
  "inspector": "测试员"
}

### 7. 缺少必填字段（应返回 400）
POST {{base}}/checklists/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNo": "NO-ID"
}
